{"title":"China TST","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>China Team Selection Test (China TST)</b> is the final stage used to determine the six students participating in the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"IMO\">IMO</a> from China.  There can be 3 to 5 individual tests in the series.\n</p>\n<table style=\"border:thin solid black;padding:10px;float:right;margin:10px;background:#fff;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"border:thin solid gray;text-align:center;background:#ccf;\"><b>China TST</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Region</b>: China\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Type</b>: Proof\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Competition_ratings\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Competition ratings\">Difficulty</a></b>: 7-10\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Difficulty Breakdown:</b>\n<p><u>Problem 1/4</u>: 7<br /><u>Problem 2/5</u>: 8.5<br /><u>Problem 3/6</u>: 10\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Structure\">Structure</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=China_TST&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Structure\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Each test has six problems split over two days, with each day having 4.5 hours to solve 3 problems.  The six students with the highest scores overall will be on China’s <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"IMO\">IMO</a> team.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=China_TST&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3282_china_team_selection_test\">AOPS Community</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017171908\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.027 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 27/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 395/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 97/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   16.518      1 Template:Contest_Info\n100.00%   16.518      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:16726:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017171908 and revision id 97576. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}